Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.70,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Ah, Aryaryagi-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.83,0:00:20.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's Araragi.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.10,0:00:22.58,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Sorry, I stuttered.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.46,0:00:26.58,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't say people's names like Careless Hachibei does.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.54,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I think that it's cuter like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.88,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Don't you think it suits you surprisingly well?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.68,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi-san, where are you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.25,0:00:38.30,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.30,0:00:39.89,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Are you going out after that?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.24,0:00:43.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, to Senjougahara's place.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.65,0:00:45.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Our midterms are coming up soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.65,0:00:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we agreed to meet up so she can tutor me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.71,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey... you still remember Senjougahara, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.71,0:00:53.11,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Oh, that tsundere.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.97,0:00:57.51,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,But as I recall...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.51,0:01:02.07,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,you and Senjougahara-san are in a boy-girl relationship, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.07,0:01:03.33,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.47,0:01:07.04,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,So, even though you say she'll be tutoring you,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.34,0:01:10.34,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,won't you just end up flirting with each other?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.59,0:01:15.61,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Just before the test that decides if you can repeat a grade or not
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.61,0:01:18.68,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,you're actually just going to your lover's place.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.68,0:01:21.89,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I personally feel that's suicidal, Araragi-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.14,0:01:25.73,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What I'm facing is whether I can graduate or not.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.99,0:01:28.31,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Also, don't say it's suicidal!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.31,0:01:30.48,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,But I feel that it is indeed suicidal.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.76,0:01:34.82,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It seems like I'll have to bring this issue to light and put an end to it sooner or later.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.78,0:01:38.03,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,That which protrudes should protrude?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.03,0:01:41.03,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Are you referring to my breasts or my butt?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.03,0:01:44.79,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Araragi-san, what are you looking for in an elementary school student's body?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.79,0:01:45.91,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.91,0:01:47.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't try to rub non-existent mistakes in people's faces!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.11,0:01:55.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, Hachikuji, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.27,0:02:12.11,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.39,0:02:14.53,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.94,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This is way too well arranged to be a coincidence!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.68,0:04:07.90,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hachikuji, that girl, she escaped.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What's been wrong with you lately?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.10,0:04:15.62,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,"This is way too well arranged to be a coincidence", huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.62,0:04:18.67,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,It seems obvious, but really is hard to think of.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.67,0:04:22.41,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,It was the perfect comment for the situation.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.41,0:04:25.21,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,This is really what you call "witty", isn't it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.72,0:04:28.70,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.05,0:04:31.92,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Actually, I was chasing after you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I figured you were.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.76,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,I see! You knew!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.14,0:04:38.93,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,As expected of Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.93,0:04:43.27,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,You completely saw through the actions of a novice like me, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.17,0:04:48.05,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,I feel so shy and embarrassed.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.05,0:04:50.80,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,But, I'm still sincere in my utmost respect towards you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.81,0:04:58.07,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't you have club activities after school?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.07,0:04:59.87,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Can you really hang around in a place like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.87,0:05:03.23,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's okay because I hurt my hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.75,0:05:07.79,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, what do you want from me today?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.79,0:05:08.70,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.72,0:05:12.38,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Have you read the world section of today's morning paper?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.38,0:05:15.01,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear your opinion...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.01,0:05:17.09,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,regarding Russia's current political situation.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.05,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What is this, a current affairs joke?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.96,0:05:24.80,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Or are you more interested in India's IT industry?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.90,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I didn't read the news this morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.90,0:05:33.57,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.36,0:05:37.16,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.94,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,did you encounter anything weird today?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.99,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Huh? No.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.99,0:05:42.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's been normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.58,0:05:47.59,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I feel like the approaching placement tests are really giving me a headache, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.59,0:05:50.24,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Later on I'm going to a study group, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.86,0:05:51.71,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Study group?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.81,0:05:54.31,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But, even though it's supposedly a study group...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.31,0:05:57.55,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's only me, one on one, receiving help.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.55,0:05:59.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's really more like me being tutored.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.98,0:06:02.14,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You see, there's someone in my class that has amazing grades...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.76,0:06:04.75,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm kinda asking them a favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.94,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,It's Senjougahara-senpai, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.65,0:06:13.60,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.60,0:06:16.32,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,If you're talking about a person with good grades in your class,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.32,0:06:19.34,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,it has to be Senjougahara-senpai, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.48,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,There have been rumors about her for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.44,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.70,0:06:30.03,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Anyway, I guess I should go then!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.82,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,I think I'll just leave for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.82,0:06:33.59,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.84,0:06:38.80,Default,Suruga,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, good luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.93,0:06:44.01,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Rararagi-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.29,0:06:49.64,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hachikuji, don't sing out my name so musically.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.64,0:06:51.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,My name is Araragi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.19,0:06:52.90,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Sorry. I stuttered.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.47,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, it was on purpose.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.97,0:06:56.94,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I st-stuttered!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.05,0:06:59.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,IT WASN'T ON PURPOSE?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.29,0:07:04.74,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, who's that person?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.74,0:07:07.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The ace of basketball; my underclassman.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.50,0:07:09.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.39,0:07:13.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,about three days ago she started blatantly following me around everywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.03,0:07:15.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Honestly, I have no clue what she wants.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.16,0:07:20.80,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Could it be that she likes you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.47,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.47,0:07:26.13,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm not the protagonist of some gal game.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.13,0:07:29.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How could I suddenly become so popular?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.67,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,My womanly instincts are telling me I'm right.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.44,0:07:37.68,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,She may confess to you in a few days.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.68,0:07:39.90,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,What will you do? What will you do?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.90,0:07:47.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You know, I don't really like when people try to explain everything with love.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.42,0:07:48.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,There's just no way.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.95,0:07:50.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But anyway, I've...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.21,0:07:54.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,already cleared the hardest character.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.37,0:07:57.71,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I feel like someone has said something bad about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.57,0:08:06.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,In any case, teaching a person to study really is difficult.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.67,0:08:23.57,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Why am I studying?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.57,0:08:25.16,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Isn't it because you're stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.12,0:08:32.83,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I haven't worried about my studies once in my life,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.83,0:08:35.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,so I don't understand what you don't understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.33,0:08:37.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Are you kidding...?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.54,0:08:42.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If I help you prepare for this placement test,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.58,0:08:45.72,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,well, at least passing won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.72,0:08:49.00,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But what exactly are you thinking of doing from now on?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.22,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,From now on?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.67,0:08:51.85,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Your future.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.85,0:08:53.10,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,My future?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.98,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even if you ask me about my future...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.98,0:08:58.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's already the end of May in your third year of high school, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.78,0:09:02.28,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You said something like being fine with just graduating,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.91,0:09:07.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,but does that mean you're going to look for a job after graduation?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.42,0:09:07.90,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.90,0:09:11.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Or does it mean that you're going to live on part time jobs? Or become a NEET?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.99,0:09:17.13,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you could go to a technical school to raise your qualifications first, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.15,0:09:18.88,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What are you, my mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.88,0:09:20.84,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Mom? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.01,0:09:24.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm your lover, aren't I?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.18,0:09:29.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,My future?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.84,0:09:33.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right. I really should decide on it soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.36,0:09:36.01,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.01,0:09:37.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Go on to university.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.58,0:09:39.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I can probably get direct admission.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.11,0:09:40.57,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.57,0:09:45.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But if possible, I'd really like to follow the same path as you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.61,0:09:49.49,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, with my grades that's a bit...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.49,0:09:50.41,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.41,0:09:52.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Maybe live together after graduation?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.65,0:09:56.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If we do that, even if our futures are different,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.87,0:10:00.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,we'd probably have even more time together than we do now.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.42,0:10:02.49,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, that wouldn't be bad, I guess...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be bad? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.13,0:10:08.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's a great idea. Let's definitely do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.36,0:10:08.97,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.64,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What exactly is "dating?"
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.81,0:10:18.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You're sighing quite a bit, aren't you, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.34,0:10:24.15,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Have you heard that every time you sigh, you lose a piece of happiness?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.15,0:10:27.35,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then I'd say I've let thousands of pieces of happiness go already.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.35,0:10:31.70,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't really care however much happiness you let go,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.70,0:10:35.19,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,but I'd really appreciate it if you didn't sigh in front of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.19,0:10:36.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Because it's annoying.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.33,0:10:39.17,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You really say some harsh things.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.17,0:10:40.79,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even though I say it's annoying,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.79,0:10:42.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm really just lovesick.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.91,0:10:46.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,When you say it like that, you make it really hard to react, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.63,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, did you know, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.74,0:10:53.04,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I... have never broken up with a guy before.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.04,0:10:56.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,So I don't intend to break up with you, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.48,0:11:02.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So that basically means that neither of us know how to appeal to the other...?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.26,0:11:04.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.97,0:11:05.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.87,0:11:08.28,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Do you still carry things like staplers around?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.28,0:11:11.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I guess I haven't been, recently.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.74,0:11:12.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,How careless.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.87,0:11:14.40,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Careless, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.79,0:11:22.44,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You were the ace of track and field during middle school, weren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.44,0:11:23.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.88,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Are you going to do track anymore?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.88,0:11:28.56,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,No. I don't have any reason to.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.56,0:11:31.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I have no intention of going back to how I was then.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.25,0:11:34.58,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.58,0:11:35.75,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.38,0:11:36.97,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.59,0:11:39.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Do you know Kanbaru Suruga?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.56,0:11:44.48,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Kanbaru Suruga? Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.90,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What a nostalgic name.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.29,0:11:47.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Oh, I see..
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.39,0:11:48.86,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So they really were friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.31,0:11:51.31,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,When I mentioned the study group,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.31,0:11:53.89,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Kanbaru didn't think of Hanekawa, the top in the class, first,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.89,0:11:56.66,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,but thought of Senjougahara instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.66,0:11:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that be the reason?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.74,0:12:02.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yeah, she was my underclassman during middle school.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.11,0:12:05.59,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Isn't she still? We're in the same school{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.59,0:12:06.68,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.68,0:12:08.24,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You say it rather affectionately, don't you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.44,0:12:15.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But what about her, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.56,0:12:22.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly, you recover from injuries rather quickly, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.99,0:12:25.53,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A mere eyeball shouldn't be a problem then, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.90,0:12:27.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.19,0:12:28.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even if it's me, eyes are bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.80,0:12:32.16,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything to feel guilty about, and I don't think of her affectionately, either!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.16,0:12:34.43,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You're my one and only!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.15,0:12:43.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so? You say rather nice things, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.42,0:12:50.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I suppose I might have gotten too worked up just now.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.13,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Did I frighten you, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.13,0:12:56.01,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,One of these days, you are going to kill someone. I know it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.01,0:12:57.85,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well when that time comes, I suppose I'll pick you, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.41,0:13:01.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'll pick you as my first opponent.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.08,0:13:03.65,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I won't pick anybody but you. I promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I don't want such a warped romance!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.61,0:13:08.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with it. Just accept it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.08,0:13:10.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Basically, me killing you
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.99,0:13:16.28,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,means that the one closest to you when you die will be me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.28,0:13:17.41,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Isn't it romantic?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.41,0:13:22.33,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No. I'd rather anyone kill me but you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No matter who I'm killed by or how I'm killed,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.46,0:13:26.67,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I feel like it would be way better than being killed by you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.67,0:13:29.35,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? I don't want that.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.59,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If you are killed by someone other than me,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.59,0:13:36.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I will kill whoever did it and screw the promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.94,0:13:40.60,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Anyway, we were talking about Kanbaru, weren't we?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.68,0:13:46.05,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Because I was the track and field ace and she was the basketball ace,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.05,0:13:49.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,even though we were in different grades, we still had some interaction.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.43,0:13:50.19,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Plus...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.19,0:13:51.28,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Plus?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.87,0:13:56.57,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even outside of club activities, in my private life,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.57,0:14:02.54,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I also imposed on her, or perhaps was made to look after her, many times.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.89,0:14:04.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.69,0:14:09.25,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Before we get into that, why did you mention her now?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.25,0:14:10.55,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Care to tell?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.03,0:14:13.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If there's nothing to hide,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.08,0:14:14.63,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,you should be able to explain this to me properly.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.21,0:14:16.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.36,0:14:19.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.48,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.48,0:14:22.02,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.52,0:14:26.77,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Above is water, below is great fire.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.77,0:14:28.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's... the furnace that heats the bath, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.65,0:14:30.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Wrong! The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.23,0:14:32.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Kanbaru Suruga's house.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.40,0:14:36.91,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do to the house of the school star?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.91,0:14:38.49,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Forget it. Anyway, jokes aside...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.99,0:14:45.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, Kanbaru discovered my secret one year earlier than you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.33,0:14:46.40,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It was when I had just become a junior in high school.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.92,0:14:53.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Basically, right after Kanbaru started at Naoetsu High School.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.43,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Judging from her personality, she...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.43,0:14:59.35,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,probably offered to help you, am I right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.35,0:15:01.15,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yes, that's exactly right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.76,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But I declined her offer.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.76,0:15:06.14,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I used the same method that I used against you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.59,0:15:11.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Despite that you still tried to help me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.89,0:15:14.49,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But Kanbaru has never come close to me after that.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.49,0:15:16.70,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's about the extent of our relationship.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.70,0:15:19.28,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But you were friends, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.14,0:15:23.29,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yeah, during middle school, we were. Now is different.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.29,0:15:24.25,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,She's just a complete stranger.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.83,0:15:29.88,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even though I get your relationship now,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.88,0:15:32.89,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,why is she following me around?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.89,0:15:38.55,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,She must have heard that we started going out.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.55,0:15:39.34,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.34,0:15:46.85,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,In other words, she's curious about what kind of guy you started dating, and came to find out about me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.85,0:15:49.17,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's probably something like that, I think.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.17,0:15:51.59,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.59,0:15:56.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Really, I guess I don't have any explanation for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.18,0:16:00.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You could say that it's my fault for managing my interpersonal relationships improperly.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.99,0:16:05.85,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But she was pushed away pretty ruthlessly by you a year ago, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.85,0:16:08.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So from then on she had nothing to do with you, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.45,0:16:12.88,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Would she really care about something like you getting a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.52,0:16:15.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It may sound strange coming from me,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.81,0:16:20.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,but to Kanbaru, I was once her idolized senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.30,0:16:27.52,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,So when I pushed her away, I tried to take extra caution so as not to leave any future problems.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.49,0:16:33.69,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But it appears that she still hasn't forgotten about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.04,0:16:37.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't call her annoying.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.54,0:16:40.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She doesn't have any ill intentions, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.20,0:16:40.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Besides{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.74,0:16:41.49,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,She {\i1}is{\i0} annoying.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.49,0:16:43.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with having ill intentions or not.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.58,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Hi. Sorry for the wait. Hanekawa speaking.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.04,0:16:59.01,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,What's up? It's really rare for you to call me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.69,0:17:02.81,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Oh, it's all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.81,0:17:04.72,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I'm just doing some light studying.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.75,0:17:14.48,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.73,0:17:18.82,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course I know that.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.96,0:17:21.40,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.32,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,The Valhalla Combination.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.22,0:17:28.94,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,They used to be known as the Valhalla Combination.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.94,0:17:32.96,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san from track and field and Kanbaru-san from basketball.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.96,0:17:34.19,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,The Valhalla Combination.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.19,0:17:35.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The Baruhara Combination?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.48,0:17:37.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What does "Baruhara" mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.61,0:17:40.88,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,The "baru" is from Kanbaru and the "hara" is from Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.88,0:17:42.30,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,That's why it's "Baruhara."
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.30,0:17:49.56,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,But it also means Valhalla, which in Norse Mythology is the hall in which the highest god, Odin, resides.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.56,0:17:54.81,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,It's the sacred hall of the god of war, where the heroes who fell in battle would be welcomed.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.65,0:17:58.98,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's the "kami" from Kanbaru and the "senjou" from Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.30,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,That's why it's the "Valhalla Combination."
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.30,0:18:03.82,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Wow, there's really someone around who thinks of names like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.82,0:18:06.78,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Well, since they were called a combination,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.78,0:18:11.98,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,they probably weren't on bad terms and didn't have too many problems, don't you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.98,0:18:13.00,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.00,0:18:18.00,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san kept participating in her club right up to graduation,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.00,0:18:21.88,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,and since both of them were in sports clubs, they must have socialized, even if only a little bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.88,0:18:24.13,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You really know everything, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.13,0:18:27.20,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I don't know everything. I just know what I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.87,0:18:34.19,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,That's right. She was popular with both the boys and girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.19,0:18:37.15,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Her reputation was very good with both her seniors and classmates.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.15,0:18:42.13,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,But really, she was probably most popular with the junior girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.13,0:18:45.72,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,That's what you really wanted to ask, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.70,0:18:51.79,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,But it shouldn't matter to you what Senjougahara-san was like in the past.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.46,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You like the current Senjougahara-san, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.25,0:19:02.71,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Liking her is good, but make sure you keep a clean and proper boy-girl relationship, okay, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.71,0:19:05.42,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san seems really serious,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.42,0:19:08.43,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,so I don't think it'll turn into a bad relationship.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.60,0:19:12.04,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,She's very complicated, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.18,0:19:19.61,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I don't mean to sound like I think I know her very well...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.61,0:19:24.19,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,but she's created an impenetrable self-field.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.19,0:19:27.40,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You have one, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.40,0:19:32.54,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Everyone has the self-field known as privacy,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.54,0:19:37.96,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,but both you and Senjougahara-san lock yourselves inside like you're being besieged.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.96,0:19:43.63,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,People like that tend to find socializing with others depressing.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.63,0:19:45.55,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You should know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.34,0:19:47.26,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Both of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.26,0:19:50.05,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,But, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.05,0:19:53.93,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Hating socializing with people is different than hating people.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.39,0:19:59.94,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I'm bothereed by the very fact that people exist, but you're an exception.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.94,0:20:05.53,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You get what I mean, right? And... what I want to say, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.49,0:20:09.66,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,It's nothing weird.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.66,0:20:13.33,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,It's completely normal to want to know more about your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.33,0:20:19.54,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,But I think it's best not to dive too deep into your lover's past.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.54,0:20:22.75,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Don't let it become half interest and half amusement.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.75,0:20:25.88,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, make sure you act in moderation in that regard.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.84,0:20:29.09,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Anyway, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.09,0:20:37.79,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,If I can, I'd like to bring back what she has lost, what she threw away.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.27,0:20:42.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,My way of thinking might be meddling in other people's business,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.36,0:20:44.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,and it could even be said to be bothersome to them.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.61,0:20:47.82,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But I can't stop thinking about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.82,0:20:51.53,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's just not possible for me to stop.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.16,0:20:56.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Could you deliver this to Oshino-san for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.37,0:20:58.00,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.70,0:21:01.62,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Oshino-san's payment.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.62,0:21:04.75,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I didn't think you would prepare it this fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.75,0:21:05.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Did you work part-time?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.05,0:21:09.88,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I helped somewhat with my father's job.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.88,0:21:13.57,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, to be precise, I should say I forced him to let me help.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.57,0:21:14.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's how I got the money.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.72,0:21:20.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She trusted me with it, and I forgot it at her house.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.22,0:22:12.05,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.26,0:22:18.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yo, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.56,0:22:23.50,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You forgot this.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.03,0:23:56.88,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}This isn't Karen!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.88,0:23:57.82,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}And I'm not Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.82,0:23:58.66,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well then, who is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.66,0:24:00.43,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{[Dejigarubi tte digitaru janai na}Daegi Galbi isn't digital.{Daegi Galbi is Korean for Pork Ribs, and is a specific type of dish.}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.43,0:24:02.19,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Robounoishi roboto janai yo ne}Roadside stones aren't robots.{Unsure}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.19,0:24:03.99,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Ranking ichi demo kingu janai}The top ranking is not the king.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.99,0:24:05.58,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Overhaul ha ana janai}An overhaul isn't a hole.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.58,0:24:07.25,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{?Schedule tte netsuryou janai ze}A schedule isn't a joule!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.25,0:24:08.87,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Eroqution ha ero janai no}Elocution isn't erotic.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.87,0:24:11.83,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Mi ni amaru kouei mini na koe nanoka sou janai no ka}An undeserved honor isn't the same as a small honor at all, is it?{Still not completely sure}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.83,0:24:14.65,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Chouai ukeru - chou ai ukeru no sou janai yo}Getting favor isn't the same as getting super lovey!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.65,0:24:15.23,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Ja nai yo na?}It really isn't?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.23,0:24:16.17,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Jai nai yo ne}Really, it's not.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.17,0:24:17.18,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}Preview quiz!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.18,0:24:17.59,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}Quiz!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.59,0:24:18.07,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}Not!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.07,0:24:18.94,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}No?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.94,0:24:20.90,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}Next time, Suruga Monkey Part 2.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.90,0:24:22.43,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}So if it's not a quiz, what is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.43,0:24:23.19,Default,PV,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a quiz...
